      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SENESCHAL (4) has been plying his trade in harder southeast QLD contests and is sure to appreciate the drop back in company here. Drawn to get all the favours from the inside alley and gets some weight off with the 2kg claim. Plenty to like about his prospects. MOOCHI STARLIGHT (8) has been on the doorstep of another victory with three consecutive runner-up finishes. Racing very consistently of late and can go one better against this line-up. LIMERO (6) is two from two over this track and trip and will strip fitter second-up from the break. Include in calculations. OUTWITTED (7) doesn't win out of turn but is usually thereabouts and looks a must for the multiples. WOLFGANG (3) is a last-start winner who shouldn't be slept on.",
